title: Cell Organization
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/red_saxony.jpg
frequency: 100

Factory and street cells are the base of our organization, individually cnosisting of a single factory, workplace, or neighborhood block that spreads propagand and agitates. Their highly localized nature lets them organize effectively even without direct orders from above.

- @more_factory_cells: We should create new factory cells to increase our industrial influence.
- @more_street_cells: To better connect with non-industrial workers, street cells should be our goal.
- @cell_defense: Order our existing cells to focus on self defense.
- @cell_propaganda: Order our cells to shift to propaganda spreading
- @return

@more_factory_cells
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); workers_spd -= 3*(1-dissent); workers_kpd -= 2*(1-dissent) if workers_spd > workers_kpd; factory_cells += 1; workers_kpd += 3(1-dissent) if factory_cells >= 4

Our factory cells agitate within their cell, leading people to join it instead of the SPD affiliated trade unions. [? if workers_spd > workers_kpd: The SPD controlled trade unions are still the dominant organization among workers, making our cells less effective. ?] [? if factory_cells >= 4: Our existing factory cells make creating additional cells much easier. ?]

@more_street_cells
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); old_middle_class_kpd += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_class_kpd += 1*(1-dissent); street_cells += 1; rfb_strength += 5; workers_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent) if street_cells <=4; unemployed_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent) if street_cells <=4; old_middle_class_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent) if street_cells <=4; new_middle_class_nsdap -= 2*(1-dissent) if street_cells <=4

Our street cells help distribute welfare and propaganda while also serving as a local defense force for rallies and demonstrations. [? if nsdap_r >= 10: We unfourtunately have to compete with the street cells of the NSDAP. ?] [? if street_cells >= 4: Our street cells have become a dominant force in some areas, making it very difficult for the NSDAP to expand there. ?]

@cell_defense
on-arrival: rfb_strength += 10; rfb_militancy += 0.02; rfb_strength += 5 if street_cells >=4; rfb_strength

Our cells focus on self defense. [if sa_strength >= 180: The growth of the SA has made this particularly important. ?]

@cell_propaganda
on-arrival: workers_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_kpd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_class_kpd += 2*(1-dissent)

Our cells focus on spreading propaganda among their cells and nearby. 